{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"lair_cave_destroyed","model_identifier":"lair_cave_destroyed","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# lair_cave_destroyed\n\nlair_cave_destroyed: the cleared / destroyed state of lair_cave.\n\nShown once players clear the lair; no spawning. Same footprint and origin as the intact model.\n\n- Cubes: 20 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 64x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -128.0..130.0, y 0.0..166.0, z -86.0..64.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- cliff: same as intact\n- rockfall: 134 x 76 x 54 centred on x = -3, z = -43\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n\n## Notes\n\n- The mouth is sealed by a rockfall of boulders piled to the lintel, only a dark sliver left at the top; most bones gone.\n"},"description":"# lair_cave_destroyed\n\nlair_cave_destroyed: the cleared / destroyed state of lair_cave.\n\nShown once players clear the lair; no spawning. Same footprint and origin as the intact model.\n\n- Cubes: 20 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 64x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -128.0..130.0, y 0.0..166.0, z -86.0..64.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- cliff: same as intact\n- rockfall: 134 x 76 x 54 centred on x = -3, z = -43\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n\n## Notes\n\n- The mouth is sealed by a rockfall of boulders piled to the lintel, only a dark sliver left at the top; most bones gone.\n","resolution":{"width":512,"height":1024},"elements":[{"name":"cliff_0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-110.0,0.0,-20.0],"to":[110